majoris-media (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Discover and select video, audio and subtitle streams through libmpv.
  * Expose chapter models/navigation and subtitle visibility controls.
  * Observe buffer underruns, seeking and active video decoder status.
  * Add GTK4 stream/chapter menus and a focused multistream regression fixture.

